{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration\/handleopenurl:"]}],"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"occ","url":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration\/handleOpenURL:"},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["occ"],"platforms":["iOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"+ (","kind":"text"},{"text":"BOOL","preciseIdentifier":"c:@T@BOOL","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"text":"handleOpenURL:","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSURL","text":"NSURL","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" *) ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"url"},{"text":";","kind":"text"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"name":"url","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The URL to process."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"content":[{"anchor":"return-value","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Return Value"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"YES if the URL was handled by Pushwoosh, NO otherwise.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Handles special Pushwoosh URLs, primarily used for:"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Test device registration"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": Register device for push testing via QR code"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Deep link tracking","type":"text"}]},{"text":": Process tracked deep links from push notifications","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Should be called from your app’s URL handling methods. Returns YES if the URL"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"was a Pushwoosh URL and was handled, NO if it should be processed by your app."}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Example","level":2,"text":"Example"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Handle URLs in SceneDelegate (iOS 13+):"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["class SceneDelegate: UIResponder, UIWindowSceneDelegate {","","    func scene(_ scene: UIScene, openURLContexts URLContexts: Set<UIOpenURLContext>) {","        guard let url = URLContexts.first?.url else { return }","","        \/\/ First, check if Pushwoosh handles this URL","        if Pushwoosh.configure.handleOpenURL(url) {","            Logger.info(\"URL handled by Pushwoosh\")","            return","        }","","        \/\/ Handle other deep links","        DeepLinkRouter.shared.handle(url)","    }","","    func scene(_ scene: UIScene, continue userActivity: NSUserActivity) {","        guard userActivity.activityType == NSUserActivityTypeBrowsingWeb,","              let url = userActivity.webpageURL else { return }","","        if Pushwoosh.configure.handleOpenURL(url) {","            return","        }","","        UniversalLinkRouter.shared.handle(url)","    }","}","","\/\/ Legacy AppDelegate support","class AppDelegate: UIApplicationDelegate {","","    func application(_ app: UIApplication,","                    open url: URL,","                    options: [UIApplication.OpenURLOptionsKey: Any] = [:]) -> Bool {","","        if Pushwoosh.configure.handleOpenURL(url) {","            return true","        }","","        return DeepLinkRouter.shared.handle(url)","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing"}]}],"abstract":[{"text":"Processes deep link URLs for Pushwoosh SDK functionality.","type":"text"}],"metadata":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"handleOpenURL:"}],"roleHeading":"Type Method","externalID":"c:objc(pl)PWConfiguration(cm)handleOpenURL:","fragments":[{"text":"+ ","kind":"text"},{"text":"handleOp